The static libraries of /usr/local/azsupport/static (azsupport/azsupport/files/deps.conf
of azsupport/ports): static, position independent libraries with the curl of PHP (the
static libcurl, only what PHP needs) and the OpenSSL of the base system, for PHP built
against them on a server, which then needs no library of /usr/local/lib. The shared
libraries of /usr/local/azsupport are the packages azsupport-<name>. Versions:
/usr/local/azsupport/share/doc/azsupport/VERSIONS.
